{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1366769-how-to-convert-the-ghost-short-story-\u201cmidnight-movie\u201d-for-the-game","id":1366769,"title":"How to convert the Ghost Short Story \u201cMidnight Movie\u201d for the game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-10T07:25:22-08:00","id":1366769,"title":"How to convert the Ghost Short Story \u201cMidnight Movie\u201d for the game","content":"At this point in the story the players are still human, and I wanted them to learn more about ghosts. Therefore I decided to use a short story that I recently read. (Learning about anchors, how to get rid of a ghost by destroying it OR how to help him move on.)<br /> <br /> Summary:<br /> A director of cheesy old horror movies dies. His movies never reached a big audience, and now that he is dead he wants to change that.<br /> A guy, who buys his old TV, starts to see a blurred version of those movies in the middle of the night at max volume. By using certain parts of those movies etc. the ghost gets his message across. The guy is able to finally get two copies of the movies of that director. After watching them alone, he also asks a female colleague to join him for a horror movie night. Since her movies don\u2019t work in the DVD player of the TV, they watch the movies of that director again while getting drunk. \u201cUsing his movies to get laid\u201d makes the ghost mad and while the guy is still drunk they get into an argument that ends with the death of that guy. The ghost used figures from his movies, a mutated rat and a \u201cpanther woman\u201d to kill that guy.<br /> <br /> The last part is where I get into trouble. Is there anything close in the rules, maybe a numen or dread power, that would make something like that possible?<br /> The players were already at the crime scene and found the traces of those animals.<br /> <br /> I hope using that story was not a big mistake...<br /> (I don\u2019t want them to draw wrong conclusions because of that.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Waiting for new Chronicles of Darkness Dice! \ud83e\udd17 \ud83c\udfb2","edited":{"userid":1825,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","user":"Elythia","date":". 05-16-2020, 05:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","name":"Elythia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1825_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T23:59:29-07:00","id":1378938,"title":"","content":"You read a story? Or you saw the movie of the same name? I wish I knew more about Geist, and the NWoD in general, but this is a rad way to go about playing the game, I'd say. Respect for that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26060-nuhxnger36","name":"NuHxnger36","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T19:06:12-07:00","id":1380823,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t know of a numen that fits exactly but I would treat it like blast with the creatures only existing for a round, if the players have found traces of the animals then they can\u2019t be just in the mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T13:59:18-07:00","id":1389063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NuHxnger36</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1366769-how-to-convert-the-ghost-short-story-\u201cmidnight-movie\u201d-for-the-game?p=1378938#post1378938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You read a story? Or you saw the movie of the same name? I wish I knew more about Geist, and the NWoD in general, but this is a rad way to go about playing the game, I'd say. Respect for that!</div> </div> </div> </div>I read a short story called \u201eMidnight Movie\u201c. (To be more precise, I listened to it on Audible. \ud83d\ude05)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Waiting for new Chronicles of Darkness Dice! \ud83e\udd17 \ud83c\udfb2","edited":{"userid":1825,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","user":"Elythia","date":". 05-16-2020, 05:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","name":"Elythia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1825_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T14:13:00-07:00","id":1389066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1366769-how-to-convert-the-ghost-short-story-\u201cmidnight-movie\u201d-for-the-game?p=1380823#post1380823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t know of a numen that fits exactly but I would treat it like blast with the creatures only existing for a round, if the players have found traces of the animals then they can\u2019t be just in the mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>At the moment I am thinking that I just let him appear as the characters/monsters of his movies, if he uses \u201cMaterialize\u201c. Or I create an alternative version of \u201eMortal Mask\u201c for him. That way I can still use the existing rules without changing much. \ud83d\ude0a<br /> <br /> ---<br /> Edit: Is there an option to delete a post? I wanted to create one reply not two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Waiting for new Chronicles of Darkness Dice! \ud83e\udd17 \ud83c\udfb2","edited":{"userid":1825,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","user":"Elythia","date":". 05-16-2020, 05:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","name":"Elythia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1825_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}